Package: libar-gsl1
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Breaks: audioreach-graphservices (<< 1.0.0-0qli+staging2)
Replaces: audioreach-graphservices (<< 1.0.0-0qli+staging2)
Description: AudioReach graph service runtime library
 The graph service layer (GSL) is the interface through which clients drive
 AudioReach audio use cases. It loads audio processing graphs onto the DSP,
 each identified by a key vector, applies calibration data from the
 calibration database, and carries audio samples between the client and the
 loaded graph.
 .
 GSL also delivers asynchronous notifications to its clients, including
 subsystem restart events that report which graph handles a client has to
 close and reopen.

